  "goodToKnow": "Kneten means to knead: Teig kneten, die Schultern kneten (massage), and to mould: Figuren aus Knete kneten. Die Knete is modelling clay, also called Knetmasse, and colloquial slang for money: Hast du genug Knete? Kitchen machines are often called Küchenmaschinen mit Knethaken (dough hooks). Regular: knetete, geknetet."
